  unitName: Dark Warrior Zephyr
  unitId: 60354
  unitNumber: 516
  description: A former Guardian who rebelled against the gods. Hearing of Sodis'
    betrayal he immediately began looking for him, hoping to meet him face to face
    to hear his reasoning. Coming to believe in the righteousness of Sodis' cause,
    Zephyr left his side to collect information. Upon returning, Zephyr saw that
    more of his Guardians friends had joined him in believing in Sodis. He smiled
    in realizing that he had chosen the correct path.
  summonDesc: Can you predict what your<br>enemies will do next?<br>If so, I will
    assist you.
  fusionDesc: Half the battle lies in preparation.<br>You mustn't neglect this.<br>Do
    you understand what I mean?
  evoDesc: My power has rapidly increased.<br>Don't be an incompitent Summoner<br>who
    relies only on power.
  element: 6
  rarity: 4
